          "jcr:created": "Wed May 24 2023 20:35:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><b><span><span class=\"futura-bold\">Keep loved ones informed&nbsp;</span></span></b><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">with secure messages using unlimited multi-lingual templates, photos, videos and group video conferencing.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
