          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Wed May 24 2023 20:35:38 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span>Measure patient and family satisfaction&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">and enable families to send positive feedback to nurses with customizable, real-time surveys.</span></span></p>\n",
