    "accordion_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 28 2019 13:17:42 GMT+0000",
      "title": "Vocera EASE FAQs",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Oct 12 2023 18:49:44 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/accordion",
      "accordion_parsys1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 1,
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 28 2019 14:11:17 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>At hospitals that support using Ease to communicate with patients, caregivers, and family members, they can download the app for free from either&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a title=\"Go to EASE app on Apple store\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ease-applications-messaging/id838601897\" target=\"_blank\">Apple</a>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<a title=\"Go to EASE app on Google Play store\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.easeapplications.receiver\" target=\"_blank\">Android</a>&nbsp;store to their mobile device.&nbsp; Once the patient or caregiver has completed a short registration process, a secure connection is established, and they will soon begin receiving updates from the healthcare provider.&nbsp;<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Oct 12 2023 18:45:42 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "accordion_parsys7": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 7,
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jul 11 2019 15:25:15 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>The Power-PRO 2 is compatible with Stryker's Power-LOAD powered cot fastener, Performance-LOAD manual cot fastener, mass casualty, wall mount and floor mount fasteners.&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jan 10 2022 14:58:38 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "accordion_parsys2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 2,
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 28 2019 14:11:17 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>After the medical provider scans the Patient/Consenting Authority's phone at the hospital, they will receive the text message inviting them to join Ease. To receive messages automatically, the Patient/Consenting Authority should presses &quot;continue&quot; on the app. On iOS, press &quot;Send&quot; when the text message screen appears.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 04 2023 15:39:54 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "accordion_parsys3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 3,
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 28 2019 14:11:17 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>After the medical provider scans the Patient/Consenting Authority's phone at the hospital during registration, invited family and friends will receive an SMS text message inviting them to join Ease.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 24 2024 18:18:03 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "accordion_parsys4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 4,
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 28 2019 14:11:17 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>VoceraEase uses 256-bit encryption to protect all communications transferred over the internet. 256-bit encryption is the same level of security as banks and credit cards use to safeguard information. Vocera Ease also abides by the same health care regulations (HIPAA and HITECH) that hospitals use to keep your protected health information safe.</p>\n<p>Vocera Ease data is protected at every level within Amazon Web Services (AWS) secure cloud. All data on the cloud is secure, and AWS is used by leading Fortune 500 companies and the US Government.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 04 2023 15:40:16 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "accordion_parsys5": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 5,
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jul 11 2019 15:25:15 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Vocera Ease leverages Amazon AWS for the highest compliance level and follows the SOC 2 Type auditing protocol. These reports are issued by independent third-party auditors covering the principles of Security, Availability, Confidentiality, and Privacy.</p>\n<p>A Veracode Assessment has been performed on the platform to ensure the highest of compliance.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 04 2023 15:40:39 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "accordion_parsys6": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "accPosId": 6,
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jul 11 2019 15:25:15 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>No. All texts, photos, and videos disappear after 60 seconds of viewing them. Nothing is saved on a device.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 04 2023 15:40:54 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
